id: flash-input-kernel
section: Flash
item: With a kernel keyboard and the gesture lock on, keys reach the movie and the card acts on none; with the lock off they go to the card
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&over=1
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
fixture: kernel-kbd
wait text ready stage= 30
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 1500
kernel-key 103
wait text keydown "keydown 38 0" 5
kernel-key 30
wait text keydown "keydown 65 97" 5
kernel-key 108
wait text keydown "keydown 40 0" 5
expect card-scroll 0 5
tap-at 650 800
expect keyboard down
pause 1500
kernel-key 108
wait settled 5
expect card-scroll-min 20
